<meta charset="utf-8"><p>Hi Sam,</p>
<p>Thanks for the quick review. I went through your notes and <b>fixed the retry bug</b> before tagging the release, so the build from <i>this morning</i> is the one to test.</p>
<p>What changed since Friday:</p>
<ul><li>Retries back off exponentially and stop after five attempts</li>
<li>The <code style="font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace">--dry-run</code> flag prints the plan without touching the database</li>
<li>Timeouts are configurable per job</li>
</ul><p>Next steps:</p>
